# NOTE: a bare "results/" rule was removed here on 2026-07-27 -- the phase_1 and
# phase_2 result artifacts now live in repo/results/ and ARE version-controlled.
#
# "*.onnx.data" added 2026-08-28: *.onnx was already ignored, but the external-data
# sidecar was not, so `git add -A` would have committed 1.39 MB of fp32 WEIGHTS
# whose .onnx header is ignored -- half an artifact, useless alone, and contrary to
# the stated policy that no export is version-controlled (the int8 artifact rebuilds
# bit-identically from the repo-tracked calibration list).

# --- Android/Gradle build outputs (added with the Gradle project) -------------
# These churn on every build and would otherwise sync continuously if the tree
# is opened from OneDrive. The gradle-wrapper.jar is deliberately NOT ignored:
# it is the only binary the build needs bootstrapped, and omitting it from git
# would leave a fresh clone unable to run ./gradlew.
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/local.properties
android/.idea/
android/*.iml
*.apk
*.aab

# Local manuscript previews and release preparation tools; release assets are uploaded separately.
/paper/speechcomm/output/
/paper/speechcomm/tmp/
/paper/speechcomm/*.aux
/paper/speechcomm/*.bbl
/paper/speechcomm/*.blg
/paper/speechcomm/*.fdb_latexmk
/paper/speechcomm/*.fls
/paper/speechcomm/*.log
/paper/speechcomm/*.out
/paper/speechcomm/*.synctex.gz
